        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "4 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service. Fixed my issue with the AC in 30 minutes. He really is knowledgeable! I have had different service over the last 30 years and always pleased!",
        "time": 1629401994,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Dan Malloy",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102023311394430457434/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocLDgkVentrNT-EBxAiOMOgfpYdWVuXX3WZl8qng_cGEFan7fQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "5 years ago",
        "text": "Complete ripoff artists. Dropped off my van for A/C service in the morning. Went to pick it up after work, but I could tell when I arrived that they hadn't even moved it. When I asked what the status was, he hesitated a bit then said \"Uh, yeah, it needs a new condenser, it's around $400\". I knew they hadn't even looked at it, so I said no thanks and took it down the street to Electricite d'auto Mastro. He charged up the system, checked it for leaks and said everything was fine. Cost me $80 and it lasted for years. I tell all my friends about both places.",
        "time": 1590513132,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Steph C",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108250382545266765869/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocK8_lYOAkRQ8aHpiWrLO4FDj-_FkweH8mgYOXkpbHobydUXRQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "Excellent service from Pierre and his team. Honest and always does his best to accommodate our schedules.  We highly recommend.  Merci, Pierre!",
        "time": 1525916622,
