        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjW3w_F53ogKA6LWQMy80wXzNOnDwtKfcduBlSZ7Ubz_BqJJWtE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "Total scam artist . Told me I needed a new radiator and gave me a quote of $1300 with parts and labor . Went to another garage down the road to find out the bottom clamp had moved ( probably because I hit some fallen object on the road) and it cost me $50 to readjust the clamp . Always get a 2nd opinion.\nAnd he charged me $100 for the stupid quote he gave me which he didn’t give back when I confronted him after the car was fixed .",
